CRYPTANALYTIC ATTACK TYPES

Attack	       VS      What the attacker knows

Ciphertext-only:	Only ciphertext samples
Known-plaintext:	Some plaintext–ciphertext pairs
Chosen-plaintext:	Can choose plaintext and obtain ciphertext
Chosen-ciphertext:	Can choose ciphertext and obtain its decryption

Brute force:    	Tries all possible keys
Frequency analysis:	Uses language letter-frequency patterns

CIW ↔ YES: known-plaintext attack.
Eve types abcdefghi: chosen-plaintext attack.
